        "content": [
          "Medicine builds its vocabulary from",
          "Greek almost entirely, and it stacks",
          "several roots into a single word.",
          "",
          "tachycardia: tachy (fast) + cardia",
          "(heart) = a fast heartbeat.",
          "",
          "cardiomyopathy: cardio (heart) +",
          "myo (muscle) + pathy (disease) =",
          "disease of the heart muscle.",
          "",
          "The ending often names the kind of",
          "fact: -itis is inflammation, -oma",
          "is a growth, -ectomy is surgical",
          "removal.",
          "",
          "Learn the pieces and a frightening",
          "diagnosis becomes a plain sentence."
        ],
